  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-30T23:10:02.374Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want a way to block children. Screaming, offensive, annoying children are really starting to ruin VR Chat. I end up blocking or muting half the people (90% of the time children) on any instance I join.\n\nThere is certainly a need for some kind of age verification system for other reasons, but I really can't stand this influx of children VR Chat seems to be having.\n\nVR Chat+ usually isn't purchased by children. Could this possibly be a way forward for some kind of basic age/person filter? Paying customers like myself might start leaving the platform if no age related features are ever implemented.",
